{"seq":5,"slug":"influence-and-legacy","title":"香农·influence-and-legacy","stage":"DONE","category":"claude-shannon","categoryLabel":"香农","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/c/people/claude-shannon/influence-and-legacy","rating":{"composite":3.73,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.67,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/19_claude-shannon/5_influence-and-legacy","introMarkdown":"# 影响与遗产\n\n要衡量一位科学家的分量，最直接的办法是问：如果没有他，今天的世界会缺少什么？对香农而言，答案近乎令人窒息——没有他，就没有可计算的「信息」，没有比特这个通用单位，也就没有手机、互联网、CD、流媒体和深空通信赖以成立的理论地基。本卷不重复他做了什么（那属于「核心贡献」与「思想方法」两卷），而专注回答另一个问题：他做的这些事，究竟在多大尺度上、以多深的方式，重塑了之后的世界。\n\n第一章「开启数字时代」落在最直接的影响上：香农如何为整个数字通信划定了可压缩的下限与可传输的上限，又如何让「比特」成为衡量一切信息的通用货币。这是一条从两条定理通向手机、光纤、ZIP 与 5G 的清晰因果链。\n\n第二章「跨领域的影响」追踪他的理论如何溢出通信工程的边界，渗进密码学、机器学习、神经科学、生物学与语言学，最终成为一门能横跨自然与人文的「统一科学」。一个为电话线设计的数学框架，竟同时照亮了大脑、基因和今天训练神经网络的损失函数。\n\n第三章「恒久的遗产」回到香农其人：一位奠定数字时代却淡泊名利、宁愿在地下室玩杂耍与机械鼠的低调天才；以及以他命名的 IEEE 香农奖如何把一门学科的最高敬意，永远献给它的奠基者。\n\n三章由近及远、由具体到宏观——从通信的地基，到跨学科的扩散，再到一个被称作「信息时代之父」的人留下的恒久印记。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"enabling-the-digital-age","title":"开启数字时代","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/claude-shannon/influence-and-legacy/enabling-the-digital-age","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-foundation-of-digital-communication","title":"数字通信的基石","url":"/c/people/claude-shannon/influence-and-legacy/enabling-the-digital-age/the-foundation-of-digital-communication"},{"seq":2,"slug":"information-everywhere","title":"无处不在的比特","url":"/c/people/claude-shannon/influence-and-legacy/enabling-the-digital-age/information-everywhere"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"influence-across-fields","title":"跨领域的影响","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/claude-shannon/influence-and-legacy/influence-across-fields","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"beyond-communication","title":"走出通信：香农理论的跨学科扩散","url":"/c/people/claude-shannon/influence-and-legacy/influence-across-fields/beyond-communication"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-unifying-science","title":"一门统一的科学","url":"/c/people/claude-shannon/influence-and-legacy/influence-across-fields/a-unifying-science"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"enduring-legacy","title":"恒久的遗产","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/claude-shannon/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-quiet-genius","title":"低调的天才","url":"/c/people/claude-shannon/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy/a-quiet-genius"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-information-age","title":"信息时代之父","url":"/c/people/claude-shannon/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy/the-information-age"}]}]}